    {
      "category": "New Features",
      "text": "Added optional AI Decision Advice that assembles sealed and redacted candidate evidence, calls configured LLM providers through an advisory-only boundary, validates and provenance-seals results, supports deterministic reuse, and renders advice in the Daily Brief without changing Candidate Engine decisions or gaining trade, write, or notification authority.",
